> > |---|---|
> > | x | y |

> First line of a paragraph,
> second line of it.
>
> - | A | B |
>   |---|---|
>   | x | y |

 > | A | B |
 > |---|---|
 > | x | y |

> - | A | B |
>   |---|---|
>   | x | y |

- > First line of a paragraph,
  > second line of it.
  >
  > | A | B |
  > |---|---|
  > | x | y |

```


